"Ruined Garden"
"Any plant life that may have grown here has long since died and withered into
nothingness.  The soil is black and sandy.  A small garden plot framed with a
wooden border rises from the surface of the ground and continues westward.  A
dense wall of trees and foliage prevents you from moving north.  The garden
continues to the east and west.  To the south, a large shattered window rests
within the wasted walls of the mansion.
